# Frontend rules

See `packages/core/standards/frontend.md`.

Highlights:
- One state library; no mixing.
- Components typed, single responsibility, one per file.
- Accessibility: keyboard reachable, labels, contrast.
- Server vs client components is intentional, not accidental.
- Lazy-load above the smallest viable shell.
- Measure before optimizing.
